00:00:09.116 --> 00:00:11.443
So this starts with an
elementary school teacher

00:00:11.443 --> 00:00:13.800
in Indiana inviting her boyfriend

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.260
to be the mystery reader for her class.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.660
The second graders were
mesmerized by his words,

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.040
but the teacher had no idea

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.780
the book had a surprise
twist at the ending.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.860
Check it out.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:27.633
- Now there is something still
missing. Yes. Just one thing.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.650
A beautiful, radiant cut diamond ring.

00:00:33.826 --> 00:00:36.576
(kids screaming)

00:00:38.086 --> 00:00:42.426
And so, Rachel, here I am
getting down on one knee.

00:00:42.426 --> 00:00:45.681
(children screaming)

00:00:45.681 --> 00:00:48.379
With all the love in my heart,

00:00:48.379 --> 00:00:49.739
will you marry me?

00:00:49.739 --> 00:00:51.516
(children screaming)

00:00:51.516 --> 00:00:52.349
Yay!

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:55.112
(audience applauding)

00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:56.090
- So cool. We have the happy couple

00:00:56.090 --> 00:01:00.150
