on WTHR in Indianapolis.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:02.728
Let's say hi to Rachel
and Austin everybody.

00:01:02.728 --> 00:01:03.561
(audience cheering)

00:01:03.561 --> 00:01:04.561
- Kelly, hi!

00:01:04.561 --> 00:01:05.394
- Hi, Kelly!

00:01:05.394 --> 00:01:06.594
(audience cheering)

00:01:06.594 --> 00:01:10.830
- That was such a cool
way to do it, Austin.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:11.850
Do you think that Rachel,

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:13.260
were you more surprised or the kids?

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.550
The kids were squealing.

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:15.900
- Yeah, the kids were squealing.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.420
It's hard to say because I had told Austin

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:22.230
