00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.250
- She loves love

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.083
- Yeah.

00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:22.145
- So much.

00:02:22.145 --> 00:02:23.250
But that was so cool that
you shared it with them too.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.110
What a special moment for all of you.

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.220
Thank you for sharing it.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:28.655
